":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.5.stable.mono.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 22621) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8129) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9820X CPU @ 3.30GHz (20 threads) - 127.6 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI want to set a default value for an automatically implemented property that stores angular velocity.\n\nThis code works:\n``` csharp\n[Export(PropertyHint.Range, \"0,3600,0.1,or_greater,radians_as_degrees,hide_slider,suffix:°/s\")]\npublic float RotationSpeed { get; set; } = Mathf.Tau;\n```\n\nBut this one doesn't (the default value is set to 0):\n``` csharp\n[Export(PropertyHint.Range, \"0,3600,0.1,or_greater,radians_as_degrees,hide_slider,suffix:°/s\")]\npublic float RotationSpeed { get; set; } = 2 * Mathf.Tau;\n```\n\nIf you replace the property with a field, the code works:\n``` csharp\n[Export(PropertyHint.Range, \"0,3600,0.1,or_greater,radians_as_degrees,hide_slider,suffix:°/s\")]\npublic float RotationSpeed = 2 * Mathf.Tau;\n```\n\nIf you use a property together with a backing field, it works:\n``` csharp\nprivate float _rotationSpeed = 2 * Mathf.Tau;\n\n[Export(PropertyHint.Range, \"0,3600,0.1,or_greater,radians_as_degrees,hide_slider,suffix:°/s\")]\npublic float RotationSpeed { get => _rotationSpeed; set => _rotationSpeed = value; }\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a C# script and attach it to a node.\n2. Copy this code inside the class:\n``` csharp\n[Export(PropertyHint.Range, \"0,3600,0.1,or_greater,radians_as_degrees,hide_slider,suffix:°/s\")]\npublic float RotationSpeed { get; set; } = 2 * Mathf.Tau;\n```\n3. Save and build project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"h